@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Customer / Staff / Driver" as MobileUsers
actor "Manager / Admin" as AdminUsers

node "Client layer" {
  component "Mobile App\nReact Native + Expo" as Mobile
  component "Web Admin\nReact + Vite" as Web
}

node "Application layer" {
  component "Backend API\nNestJS + REST /api/v1" as API
  component "Realtime Gateway\nSocket.IO" as Realtime
  component "Authentication &\nAuthorization (JWT/RBAC)" as Auth
  component "Business modules\nOrders / Pricing / Trips /\nManifest / Delivery / COD / Incidents" as Modules
}

database "PostgreSQL\n(Prisma ORM)" as DB
cloud "Object Storage\n(S3-compatible / MinIO)" as Storage
cloud "External providers\nSMS/OTP / Push / Maps" as External

MobileUsers --> Mobile
AdminUsers --> Web
Mobile --> API : HTTPS JSON
Web --> API : HTTPS JSON
Mobile <--> Realtime : Socket.IO
Web <--> Realtime : Socket.IO
API --> Auth
API --> Modules
Realtime --> Auth : validate access token
Modules --> DB : read/write
API --> DB : Prisma
API --> Storage : presigned upload metadata
Mobile --> Storage : upload via presigned URL
Web --> Storage : upload via presigned URL
Modules --> External : HTTPS API/SDK
Realtime --> Modules : publish domain events

note bottom of DB
Client không truy cập trực tiếp CSDL.
Backend là nguồn dữ liệu chuẩn.
end note
@enduml
